            "ordered": false,
            "values": "<li><strong>VA-Approved Experts:</strong> We work directly with VA programs and understand the grant process inside and out.</li><li><strong>Full-Service Support:</strong> From initial assessment to final inspection, we handle every step of your home modification project.</li><li><strong>Quality Installations:</strong> Our licensed, certified team ensures every modification meets or exceeds safety and accessibility standards.</li><li><strong>Veteran-Focused:</strong> We're committed to serving those who served, with dignity and respect throughout the entire process.</li>"
